  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4202.67 Thinning recommendation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4202.67 “Thinning recommendation” means:\n\n(a) For coatings manufactured before January 1, 2007, the manufacturer’s thinning instructions either on the container label, in literature describing the product, or on the manufacturer's website; and\n\n(b) For coatings manufactured on or after January 1, 2007, the manufacturer’s thinning instructions on the coating container’s label or lid.\n\nSource. #8695, eff 7-27-06, ss by #10736, eff 1-1-15 (formerly Env-A 4202.01(bo)); ss by #14202, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4200.html"
